<title>USA: Kennedy-Wilson completes financing package.</title>
<headline>Kennedy-Wilson completes financing package.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kennedy-Wilson Inc, a provider of real estate marketing and investment services, said Monday it completed arrangements for over $200 million in acquisition financing and commitments.</p>
<p>&quot;Our strong portfolio performance, as well as the success of all our business lines, has enabled us to secure these excellent financing options,&quot; Freeman Lyle, chief financial officer, said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company received a $100 million facility from Nomura Asset Capital Corp, an $84 million line from Heller Financial Inc and $18 million in credit from two other institutions.</p>
</text>
